{"id":"7fb3f0cae2513880ee4a5d1e41dcf6b22174a0f0","axis":"silent","repo":"grafana/tempo","sha":"7fb3f0cae2513880ee4a5d1e41dcf6b22174a0f0","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".chloggen/s3-directory-buckets.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@","+# Changelog entry. Generate a copy with `make chlog-new`, then fill in the fields.","+","+# One of: breaking | change | feature | enhancement | bug_fix | security","+change_type: feature","+","+# Component or area of the change. Must be one of the components in .chloggen/config.yaml,","+# e.g. distributor, querier, query-frontend, storage, operations.","+component: storage","+","+# A brief description of the change. Surround with quotes (\"\") if it must start with a backtick (`).","+note: Add the s3express storage backend for S3 directory buckets, in Availability Zones (S3 Express One Zone) and Local Zones, which the s3 backend can't start on.","+","+# (Optional) PR number(s), e.g. [7339]. Leave blank to auto-fill at release. See","+# .chloggen/README.md.","+issues: []","+","+# (Optional) Additional lines rendered under the note. Use a pipe (|) for multiline text.","+subtext: |","+  The s3express backend takes the options of the s3 backend. It authenticates with S3 Express sessions (CreateSession), like the AWS SDKs, and lists objects with ListObjectsV2, without `start-after` or relying on key order.","+  The s3 backend is unchanged.","+","+# The GitHub handle (without the leading @) of the change's author. Rendered as \"(@handle)\".","+user: akin-ozer"],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"cmd/tempo-cli/main.go","lines":["@@ -11,11 +11,13 @@ import ("," \t\"go.yaml.in/yaml/v2\""," "," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/cmd/tempo/app\"","+\t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend/azure\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend/gcs\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend/local\""," \t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend/s3\"","+\t\"github.com/grafana/tempo/v3/tempodb/backend/s3express\""," )"," "," type globalOptions struct {","@@ -28,13 +30,48 @@ type outputOptions struct {"," }"," "," type backendOptions struct {","-\tBackend string `help:\"backend to connect to (s3/gcs/local/azure), optional, overrides backend in config file\" enum:\",s3,gcs,local,azure\" default:\"\"`","+\tBackend string `help:\"backend to connect to (s3/s3express/gcs/local/azure), optional, overrides backend in config file\" enum:\",s3,s3express,gcs,local,azure\" default:\"\"`"," \tBucket  string `help:\"bucket (or path on local backend) to scan, optional, overrides bucket in config file\"`"," ","-\tS3Endpoint         string `name:\"s3-endpoint\" help:\"s3 endpoint (s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com), optional, overrides endpoint in config file\"`","-\tS3User             string `name:\"s3-user\" help:\"s3 username, optional, overrides username in config file\"`","-\tS3Pass             string `name:\"s3-pass\" help:\"s3 password, optional, overrides password in config file\"`","-\tInsecureSkipVerify bool   `name:\"insecure-skip-verify\" help:\"skip TLS verification, only applies to S3 and GCS\" default:\"false\"`","+\tS3Endpoint         string `name:\"s3-endpoint\" help:\"s3 or s3express endpoint (s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com), optional, overrides endpoint in config file\"`","+\tS3User             string `name:\"s3-user\" help:\"s3 or s3express username, optional, overrides username in config file\"`","+\tS3Pass             string `name:\"s3-pass\" help:\"s3 or s3express password, optional, overrides password in config file\"`","+\tInsecureSkipVerify bool   `name:\"insecure-skip-verify\" help:\"skip TLS verification, only applies to S3, S3 Express and GCS\" default:\"false\"`","+}","+","+// apply overrides the trace storage config with the options that are set.","+func (b *backendOptions) apply(trace *tempodb.Config) {","+\tif b.Backend != \"\" {","+\t\ttrace.Backend